# Node
node_modules/

# Capacitor native projects — generated locally with
# `npx cap add ios` / `npx cap add android` (needs Xcode / Android SDK).
# The firm's hardening edits (see README.md "Native shell hardening") must be
# re-applied after regeneration, so keep them as a patch or script; the
# generated shells themselves are never committed.
/ios/
/android/

# Tooling noise
.DS_Store
*.log
*.tsbuildinfo
www/server.js

# Xcode per-user state for the local Swift package
.swiftpm/

# Fluid Speech Mini weights, fetched by `npm run speech-model` (never committed).
/plugins/speech/ios/Sources/MikeSpeechPlugin/FluidSpeechMini/
